# Unity — generated, machine-specific, or enormous. If the Unity project lives
# in this repo, these keep it to the parts that are actually yours.
[Ll]ibrary/
[Tt]emp/
[Oo]bj/
[Bb]uild/
[Bb]uilds/
[Ll]ogs/
